                                                                                                                <comments>
                            <comment id="15526003" author="sboikov" created="Tue, 27 Sep 2016 12:43:55 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Changed TcpDiscoveryMulticastIpFinder.requestAddresses to do not stop when first remote address is received.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Better fix is send together with adress flag indicating whether node already joined topology, requestAddresses can stop when address from joined node is received. But this breaks binary compatibility.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
